    "text": "beckershospitalreview.com\nwebsite\nFredericksburg\nLongtime Mary Washington Healthcare CFO retiring, successor named\nBy Andrew Cass,15 hours ago\nSean Barden, executive vice president and CFO of Fredericksburg, Va.-based Mary Washington Healthcare, is retiring after more than 17 years in the role. Thomas Mathews has been named the system’s new executive vice president and CFO, according to a news release shared with Becker’s on July 9. He joins Mary Washington from UnityPoint Health-Des Moines (Iowa), where he served as regional CFO.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
